sequenceDiagram
  participant Sender
  participant Platform
  participant DNS
  participant Receiver
  Sender->>Platform: Submit envelope and RFC 5322 message
  Platform->>DNS: Read SPF/DKIM/DMARC policy
  Platform->>Platform: Authorize tenant and sign DKIM when enabled
  Platform->>Receiver: SMTP delivery with authentication signals
  Receiver->>DNS: Evaluate SPF, DKIM key, and DMARC policy
  Receiver-->>Platform: SMTP result / optional report
  Platform->>Platform: Record status without claiming inbox placement
